      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso, Col. III, right",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Cr. Profit from the tin 5d</li>\n<li>Cr. two and a half years rent in the house 30d</li>\n<li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Total 713d. 7q.</li>\n<li>Debit, as summed up 133\u2154(d.)1q.</li>\n<li>Balance in his favour 579\u2153 &frac14;d.</li>\n<li>Dr. for the house behind the synagogue 1d.</li>\n<li>Dr. for the poll tax 1d.</li>\n<li>Dr. price of half a mann of spikenard 10q.</li>\n<li>Dr. his note to Ab\u016b \u02bfAl\u012b 20d. less 2q.</li>\n<li><del>Dr. note handed to Isma\u02bfil for a purse of the Treasury&nbsp;</del></li>\n<li><del> &nbsp; 30 \u2153 &frac14; d. loose gold 20d.</del></li>\n<li>Specification of the sale of the (dinars) received from Ibn al-Sukkar\u012b</li>\n<li>Through Ab\u016b \u02bfImr\u0101n 17 less &frac12;q. 18d.</li>\n<li>Through myself 12 less 1&frac12;q. 12\u2154</li>\n<li>Through Ab\u016b \u02bfAl\u012b 96&frac12; \u215b 95 (d.) 2q.</li>\n<li>Through (Torn away) 5d.</li>\n<li>... half a din. Total 131&frac14;&nbsp;</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
